@{60411ec5cc01c21febdcbe37|full_name} How can you make a fanfic about reasons I get kicked only from what has been said here? 💀

But i can list you a lot of them that happened with me and my friends:

Kicked because the mod didn't liked my voice;

Banned because i removed the group owner from my friendlist (he was too toxic and too simp);

Friend banned because he said "balls" in the chatbox;

Friend kicked from another group not related to the one above because he said "balls" in the chatbox;

A lot of friends banned because they were frequenting instances of a "rival" group;

Friends banned because they were representing a group the instance owner didn't liked (nothing offensive or innapropriate);

Friend banned because the mod discovered the person don't like him;

Quest user banned because the owner didn't wanted to explain him his avatar was using suggestive clothings in pc version (while the quest user itself had no idea, it was just toxic, he was being cooperative);

Banned because asked the mods to kick the kids;

Friend banned because used the water droplets emoji (mutually, and only him got banned (a mod steped in and called it "webrape"));

Friend banned for absolutely no reason two times from the same group (one ban got lifted after a month complaining to the owner, which he himself couldn't give a reason but was being lazy to unban), and, after less than a week, banned again for no reason.

And this.. This happened just too many times to count: group mods flying around a closed group of friends SEARCHING for reasons to ban them. Any intimate joke? Any quick (and non global) sound effect? Any quick (and non global) visual effect? Literally, anything. Instead of playing the actual game, instance moderators are looking for reasons to exercise power;

Banned because spawned prints in the world (nothing offensive or innapropriate).

There is more.
